wf-asf-department = Astraeus Solar Federation
wf-asf-department-description = Represent the Federation at Lantern Post: help whoever docks, study the sector and keep the door open.
wf-asf-access-crew = ASF
wf-asf-access-command = ASF Command
wf-asf-radio = ASF

wf-asf-job-supervisors-council = the Federation council
wf-asf-job-supervisors-envoy = the Envoy
wf-asf-job-envoy = ASF Envoy
wf-asf-job-envoy-description = Speak for the Federation in the sector. Run Lantern Post, receive visitors and keep the peace with every neighbour, the Trans-Solar Federation included.
wf-asf-job-field-researcher = ASF Field Researcher
wf-asf-job-field-researcher-description = Study the sector and share what you learn. Take a survey ship out, bring back findings and help anyone you meet along the way.
wf-asf-job-colonist = ASF Colonist
wf-asf-job-colonist-description = Keep Lantern Post running and put down roots. Build, grow, repair and haul for the Federation.
wf-asf-job-enforcer = ASF Enforcer
wf-asf-job-enforcer-description = Keep Lantern Post and its visitors safe. Defuse trouble before it starts and use force only as a last resort.

wf-asf-lantern-subtext = Astraeus Solar Federation base ship
wf-asf-lantern-description = A shielded Federation base ship with a public concourse, garden, clinic and consular office, open to anyone who docks. Members also get a bridge, a shipyard, a farm, an R&D lab and an anomaly test chamber, and the whole post can fly.

ent-WFAsfEncryptionKey = ASF encryption key
    .desc = An encryption key for the Federation's channel.
ent-WFAsfClothingHeadset = ASF headset
    .desc = A headset fitted with a key for the Federation's channel.
ent-WFAsfAirlock = ASF airlock
ent-WFAsfAirlockGlass = ASF glass airlock
ent-WFAsfAirlockCommand = ASF command airlock
ent-WFAsfVoucherCivilian = ASF civilian LPC
    .desc = A purple procurement card good for one Gleaner, Porter or Lamplighter from an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfVoucherEscort = ASF escort LPC
    .desc = A purple procurement card good for one Vigil or Bulwark from an ASF shipyard console. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfVoucherLodestar = ASF Lodestar LPC
    .desc = A purple procurement card that releases one Lodestar flagship frigate from an ASF shipyard console. Lodestars are never sold for credits. Destroyed on use.
ent-WFAsfShieldGenerator = Federation bastion shield generator
    .desc = A station-grade shield generator that wraps Lantern Post in a violet field. It draws a great deal of power.
ent-WFAsfResearchServer = ASF R&D server
    .desc = Holds the Federation's research in the sector, including its ship procurement patterns.
ent-WFAsfLathe = ASF fabricator
    .desc = A Federation fabricator that prints ship procurement cards and shipgun ammunition from researched patterns.

